{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>He had not come near her.</b> The angel restrained him, as is said: ״לֹא נְתַתִּיךָ לִנְגֹּעַ אֵלֶיהָ״." "<b>The nation, even though righteous, will you kill?</b> Even if he is righteous — will you kill him? Perhaps this is your way, to destroy the nations for nothing? So you did to the generation of the Flood and to the generation of the Dispersion; so too I say that you killed them for no reason, just as you say to kill me."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:59:35.556284279Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}